  "releaseNotes": "## [8.0.1] - 2025-06-09\n\n\t\t\t### Removed\n\t\t\t- Removed dependency on `Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.Features`. This reduces package size and eliminates unnecessary transitive dependencies.\n\t\t\tNo breaking changes are expected for consumers.\n\n\t\t\t## [8.0.2] - 2025-06-09\n\n\t\t\t### Changed\n\n\t\t\t- **Corrected Example Response in README:**\n\t\t\tThe example JSON response under the \"Example\" section of the README has been updated for accuracy and clarity. This ensures users see the correct output format when using the `$project` feature for dynamic JSON projection.\n\n\t\t\t### Notes\n\n\t\t\t- No changes to the library code or APIs.\n\t\t\t- This update is documentation-only.",
